You definitely should sum the accumulated normal impulses when determining the maximum centeral friction. This will approximate integration over the manifold surface.<br><br>I would use the dynamic friction limit if the tangential velocity from the end of the last step is above a threshold, otherwise I would use the static friction limit.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=12">Erin Catto</a> — Fri Sep 22, 2006 4:47 am</p><hr />
